<title>INDIA: India's HDFC board meets on Oct 15 for results.</title>
<headline>India's HDFC board meets on Oct 15 for results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Housing Development and Finance Corporation's (HDFC) board meets on October 15 to announce its six month results to September 30, 1996, the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
